            <div xml:id="d881">

                <pb facs="0809" n="797" sameAs="frus:frus1940v01/pg797"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.Consultation (2)/254a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Guatemala</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-07-10T18:00:00-04:00">July 10, 1940—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>54. A United Press item from Guatemala City states that the German Minister has
                    criticised by note to the Guatemalan Government the forthcoming meeting of
                    Foreign Ministers at Habana. Please investigate discreetly and report by
                    telegraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
